ions\/help-us-touch-their-lives-of-these-youths\/\">Help us touch their lives of these youths<\/h3> Raised - &#036;325.00 Goal - &#036;70,000.00<a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/donations\/help-us-touch-their-lives-of-these-youths\/\">Donate Now<\/a><img width=\"354\" height=\"233\" src=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/donation4-2-1-354x233.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/donation4-2-1-354x233.png 354w, https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/donation4-2-1-342x225.png 342w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 354px) 100vw, 354px\" \/>0.03%<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/donations\/help-children-poor-insurance-medical\/\">Help Children poor Insurance &#038; Medical<\/h3> Raised - &#036;25.00 Goal - &#036;80,000.00<a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/donations\/help-children-poor-insurance-medical\/\">Donate Now<\/a><img width=\"354\" height=\"233\" src=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/donation5-1-2-1-354x233.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/donation5-1-2-1-354x233.png 354w, https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/donation5-1-2-1-342x225.png 342w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 354px) 100vw, 354px\" \/>0%<h3><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/donations\/your-little-help-can-heal-their-helps\/\">Your Little Help Can Heal Their Helps<\/h3> Raised - &#036;0 Goal - &#036;90,000.00<a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/donations\/your-little-help-can-heal-their-helps\/\">Donate Now<\/a>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Image --><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/cta_shape2_1-2-1.png\" alt=\"Shape Image\" ><!-- End Image -->\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Image --