{"ID":203,"post_content":"<img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/feature-card-bg-shape1-1-2-1.png\" alt=\"feature card bg shape1 1 2 1\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/feature-icon1-2-2-1.svg\" alt=\"feature icon1 2 2 1\"  \/><h3>Donor Friendly<\/h3><p>Stay updated with the latest news, events, and impact stories from our organization. Subscribe to our newsletter.<\/p><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/about\/\">View Details<\/a><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/feature-card-bg-shape1-1-2-1.png\" alt=\"feature card bg shape1 1 2 1\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/feature-icon1-1-2-1.svg\" alt=\"feature icon1 1 2 1\"  \/><h3>Fundraising Trust<\/h3><p>Stay updated with the latest news, events, and impact stories from our organization. Subscribe to our newsletter.<\/p><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/about\/\">View Details<\/a><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/feature-card-bg-shape1-1-2-1.png\" alt=\"feature card bg shape1 1 2 1\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/feature-icon1-2-2-1.svg\" alt=\"feature icon1 2 2 1\"  \/><h3>Charity Donate<\/h3><p>Stay updated with the latest news, events, and impact stories from our organization. Subscribe to our newsletter.<\/p><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/about\/\">View Details<\/a><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/feature-card-bg-shape1-1-2-1.png\" alt=\"feature card bg shape1 1 2 1\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/feature-icon1-1-2-1.svg\" alt=\"feature icon1 1 2 1\"  \/><h3>Treatment Help<\/h3><p>Stay updated with the latest news, events, and impact stories from our organization. Subscribe to our newsletter.<\/p><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/about\/\">View Details<\/a>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Image --><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/heart-shape1-2-1.png\" alt=\"Shape Image\" ><!-- End Image -->\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/about_1_1-2.png\" alt=\"about_1_1 2\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/about_shape1_1-1-2.png\" alt=\"about_shape1_1 1 2\"  \/>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tAbout Us Donat<h2>We Believe that We can Save More Life's with you<\/h2><p>Donet is the largest global crowdfunding community connecting nonprofits, donors, and companies in nearly every country. We help nonprofits from Afghanistan to Zimbabwe (and hundreds of places in between) access the tools, training, and support they need to be more effective and make our world a better place.<\/p>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li data-theme-color=\"#1A685B\">Charity For Foods<\/li><li data-theme-color=\"#FFAC00\">Charity For Water<\/li><li data-theme-color=\"#FF5528\">Charity For Education<\/li><li data-theme-color=\"#122F2A\">Charity For Medical<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/about\/\">About More<\/a>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Image --><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_bg_shape3_1-2-1.png\" alt=\"Shape Image\" ><!-- End Image -->\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Image --><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_bg_shape3_2-2-1.png\" alt=\"Shape Image\" ><!-- End Image -->\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Image --><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_bg_shape3_3-2-1.png\" alt=\"Shape Image\" ><!-- End Image -->\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Image --><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_bg_shape3_4-2-1.png\" alt=\"Shape Image\" ><!-- End Image -->\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Image --><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_bg_shape3_5-2-1.png\" alt=\"Shape Image\" ><!-- End Image -->\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Image --><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_bg_shape3_6-2-1.png\" alt=\"Shape Image\" ><!-- End Image -->\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tOur Volunteer<h2>Meet The Optimistic Volunteer<\/h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_3_3-2-1.png\" alt=\"team_3_3 2 1\"  \/><h3><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/team-details\/\">Michel Connor<\/a><\/h3>Volunteer  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/facebook.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/instagram.com\/\"><\/a>\n <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/behance.com\/\"><\/a><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_3_1-2-1.png\" alt=\"team_3_1 2 1\"  \/><h3><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/team-details\/\">Michel Connor<\/a><\/h3>Volunteer  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/facebook.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/instagram.com\/\"><\/a>\n <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/behance.com\/\"><\/a><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_3_2-1-2-1.png\" alt=\"team_3_2 1 2 1\"  \/><h3><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/team-details\/\">Jessica Lauren<\/a><\/h3>Volunteer  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/facebook.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/instagram.com\/\"><\/a>\n <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/behance.com\/\"><\/a><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_3_3-2-1.png\" alt=\"team_3_3 2 1\"  \/><h3><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/team-details\/\">Daniel Thomas<\/a><\/h3>Volunteer  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/facebook.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/instagram.com\/\"><\/a>\n <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/behance.com\/\"><\/a><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_3_3-2-1.png\" alt=\"team_3_3 2 1\"  \/><h3><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/team-details\/\">Michel Connor<\/a><\/h3>Volunteer  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/facebook.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/instagram.com\/\"><\/a>\n <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/behance.com\/\"><\/a><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_3_1-2-1.png\" alt=\"team_3_1 2 1\"  \/><h3><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/team-details\/\">Michel Connor<\/a><\/h3>Volunteer  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/facebook.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/instagram.com\/\"><\/a>\n <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/behance.com\/\"><\/a><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_3_2-1-2-1.png\" alt=\"team_3_2 1 2 1\"  \/><h3><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/team-details\/\">Jessica Lauren<\/a><\/h3>Volunteer  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/facebook.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/instagram.com\/\"><\/a>\n <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/behance.com\/\"><\/a><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/team_3_3-2-1.png\" alt=\"team_3_3 2 1\"  \/><h3><a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/team-details\/\">Daniel Thomas<\/a><\/h3>Volunteer  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/facebook.com\/\"><\/a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/instagram.com\/\"><\/a>\n <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/behance.com\/\"><\/a>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/video_bg_shape3_1-2-1.png\" alt=\"video_bg_shape3_1 2 1\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/video_bg_shape3_2-2-1.png\" alt=\"video_bg_shape3_2 2 1\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/video-thumb3-1-2-1.png\" alt=\"video thumb3 1 2 1\"  \/><a href=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=_sI_Ps7JSEk\"><\/a>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>15K+<\/h2> <p>Incredible Volunteers<\/p><h2>1K+<\/h2> <p>Successful Campaigns<\/p><h2>400+<\/h2> <p>Monthly Donors<\/p><h2>35K+<\/h2> <p>Team Support<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Image --><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/hand-bg-shape2-1-2-1.png\" alt=\"Shape Image\" ><!-- End Image -->\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tWork Process<h2>Our Donating Work Process<\/h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/process-card-1-1-2-1.png\" alt=\"process card 1 1 2 1\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/process-icon1-1-2-1.svg\" alt=\"process icon1 1 2 1\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/process-card-shape2-2-1.png\" alt=\"process card shape2 2 1\"  \/><h3>Awareness &amp; Engagement<\/h3><p>To inform and engage potential donors and supporters about the charity\u2019s mission and the cause it supports. Utilize various channels such as social media.<\/p><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/process-card-1-1-2-1.png\" alt=\"process card 1 1 2 1\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/process-icon1-2-2-1.svg\" alt=\"process icon1 2 2 1\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/process-card-shape2-2-1.png\" alt=\"process card shape2 2 1\"  \/><h3>Donation Collection<\/h3><p>Set up a secure and user-friendly online donation platform that accepts multiple payment methods and allows for both one-time and recurring donations.<\/p><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/process-card-1-1-2-1.png\" alt=\"process card 1 1 2 1\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/process-icon1-3-2-1.svg\" alt=\"process icon1 3 2 1\"  \/><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/process-card-shape2-2-1.png\" alt=\"process card shape2 2 1\"  \/><h3>Impact and Accountability<\/h3><p>Allocate funds to specific projects and initiatives that align with the charity\u2019s mission, ensuring that resources are used efficiently and effectively.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Image --><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/footer-bg-shape3-2-1.png\" alt=\"Shape Image\" ><!-- End Image -->\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- Image --><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/testimonial_shape1_1-2-1.png\" alt=\"Shape Image\" ><!-- End Image -->\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\tTestimonials<h2>What People Say About <br> Our Charity<\/h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t  <img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/testi_1_1-2-1.png\" alt=\"testi_1_1 2 1\"  \/>5.0 <img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/testi_1_2-2-1.png\" alt=\"testi_1_2 2 1\"  \/>5.0 <img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/testi_1_1-2-1.png\" alt=\"testi_1_1 2 1\"  \/>5.0 <img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/testi_1_2-2-1.png\" alt=\"testi_1_2 2 1\"  \/>5.0<p>\u201cStay informed about our upcoming events and campaigns. Whether it&#039;s a fundraising gala, a charity run, or a community outreach program, there are plenty of ways to get involved and support our cause. Check our event calendar for details. We prioritize your security. Our donation process uses the latest encryption technology to protect your personal and financial information. Donate with confidence knowing\u201d<\/p> <h3>Alex Furnandes<\/h3><p>CEO, Founder<\/p><p>\u201cStay informed about our upcoming events and campaigns. Whether it&#039;s a fundraising gala, a charity run, or a community outreach program, there are plenty of ways to get involved and support our cause. Check our event calendar for details. We prioritize your security. Our donation process uses the latest encryption technology to protect your personal and financial information. Donate with confidence knowing\u201d<\/p> <h3>Mustafa Kamal<\/h3><p>CEO, Founder<\/p><p>\u201cStay informed about our upcoming events and campaigns. Whether it&#039;s a fundraising gala, a charity run, or a community outreach program, there are plenty of ways to get involved and support our cause. Check our event calendar for details. We prioritize your security. Our donation process uses the latest encryption technology to protect your personal and financial information. Donate with confidence knowing\u201d<\/p> <h3>Alex Furnandes<\/h3><p>CEO, Founder<\/p><p>\u201cStay informed about our upcoming events and campaigns. Whether it&#039;s a fundraising gala, a charity run, or a community outreach program, there are plenty of ways to get involved and support our cause. Check our event calendar for details. We prioritize your security. Our donation process uses the latest encryption technology to protect your personal and financial information. Donate with confidence knowing\u201d<\/p> <h3>Mustafa Kamal<\/h3><p>CEO, Founder<\/p> <button data-slider-prev=\"#testiSlide1\"><\/button> <button data-slider-next=\"#testiSlide1\"><\/button> \t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h2>Trusted by over 90K+ companies worldwide<\/h2>\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t   <a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/blog\/\"><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/brand1-1-2-1.svg\" alt=\"brand1 1 2 1\"  \/><\/a>  <a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/blog\/\"><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/brand1-2-2-1.svg\" alt=\"brand1 2 2 1\"  \/><\/a>  <a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/blog\/\"><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/brand1-3-2-1.svg\" alt=\"brand1 3 2 1\"  \/><\/a>  <a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/blog\/\"><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/brand1-4-2-1.svg\" alt=\"brand1 4 2 1\"  \/><\/a>  <a href=\"https:\/\/wordpress.themehour.net\/donat\/blog\/\"><img src=\"https:\/\/pink-curlew-962546.hostingersite.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/09\/brand1-5-2-1.svg\" alt=\"brand1 5 2 1\"  \/><\/a>","post_title":"About","post_status":"publish","post_name":"about","post_parent":0}
